// THE CULTIVAR — Plant Grow Script
// Version: 1.0
// Handles: Growth timer, stage progression, strain data,
//          yield and quality calculation, visual stage updates
//
// GROWTH STAGES:
//   0 = Empty pot (no seed planted)
